# --- working documents: never publish (managed) ---
# Engagement/outreach plans, funding proposals, cover notes and unpublished
# article drafts stay on disk but must never reach this public repo.
# If one ever truly belongs here: git add -f <path>
.DS_Store
~$*
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
**/outreach/
*ngagement-Plan*
*ngagement-plan*
/A11y/

# Unpublished article drafts and research dossiers live under docs/.
# Nothing on the published repo links into it. Extension rules alone are not
# enough: the LWN research dossiers are .md, so *.docx would not catch them,
# and the stealth rule applies to drafts in any format until an outlet accepts.
/docs/
